opencode-cline-pass
===================

This project is an independent opencode implementation of the behavior
specified by dsh-cline-pass:

  https://github.com/yhshzh/dsh-cline-pass
  Copyright (c) dsh-cline-pass contributors
  Licensed under the MIT License.

The routing, account-pool, probing, pinning, and failover semantics — and
some user-facing wording — are ported from that project's public source and
documentation. dsh-cline-pass in turn credits cline-pass-switcher:

  https://github.com/munmunjaklin458-afk/cline-pass-switcher
  Licensed under the MIT License.

This project is not affiliated with Cline. "Cline" and "Cline Pass" are
trademarks of their respective owners.
